<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss launch 12-month money market claims.</title>
<headline>Swiss launch 12-month money market claims.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Swiss federal government is issuing 12-month money market claims to be paid for on January 30, the Swiss National Bank said.</p>
<p>The allocation follows the end of subscriptions on January 28.</p>
<p>The previous issue of three-month claims, paid for on January 23, raised 1,109.75 million francs and was priced at 99.607 percent to yield 1.561 percent annually.</p>
<p>-- Zurich editorial, +41 1 258 7340</p>
</text>
